  "plain": "In January 1996, in the Brazilian town of Varginha, many people say a strange craft came down and a living non-human creature was caught and taken to local hospitals. A surgeon named Italo Venturelli says he saw army trucks with green canvas covers lined up at the entrance of the town's Regional Hospital. If true, it would point to the military quietly handling something at the hospital that week."
